  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 727a75301c3d24613a3ebcec4a24c2c8, type: 3}
  title: MOVIN Unity Plugin V3
  sections:
  - heading: Overview
    text: MOVIN Unity Plugin v3.3.0 receives motion, point clouds, and status requests from MOVIN Studio v3.3.0 or later over OSC/UDP.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Quick Start
    text: Open Assets/MOVIN/Scenes/Sample_MOVINman.unity, enter Play mode, and select the Unity target in MOVIN Studio. Send to this computer on UDP port 11235.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Included Samples
    text: Sample_MOVINman uses Assets/MOVIN/Character/MOVINman/MOVINman_V3.prefab. Sample_Ch14 and Sample_Ch29 provide additional Mixamo character setups. Install Core before Samples.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Receiver Components
    text: MOVINStreamReceiver receives MOVIN Studio motion and point clouds over OSC/UDP. MOVIN.MocapReceiver applies streamed root and bone poses to a character hierarchy. MotionStreamMonitorUI shows packet, frame, drop, latency, and processing status at runtime.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Studio Status
    text: The receiver reports character identity, bone compatibility, and received FPS to MOVIN Studio automatically.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Downloads and Compatibility
    text:
    linkText: MOVIN Unity Plugin releases
    url: https://github.com/MOVIN3D/MOVIN-Unity-Plugin-V3/releases
  loadedLayout: 1
